  "display_title": "Two Tigers, Too Close",
  "description": "When brawler Kang Ji-Hwan is forced to transfer schools, the last thing he expects is to rely on the top student in class. But after accidentally tearing model-student Han Yu-Seong’s uniform, and discovering the fierce tiger tattoo hidden on his back, Ji-Hwan offers a deal: he’ll keep Yu-Seong’s secret if Yu-Seong becomes his tutor. To push Ji-Hwan away, Yu-Seong turns up the heat with bold, intimate teasing… but the closer he gets, the more Ji-Hwan finds himself drawn in. Between hidden claws and rising tension, two boys with tiger hearts may be getting far too close for comfort.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Season 2 is rated R19.*",
